# Phase 16-4 (#100, Q8, Q10): the shown panel sets are re-picked at every
# restart and every PANEL_ROTATE_TICKS (3 h) of wall-clock time (the RTC:
# time asleep counts), with no image work: recently played and newest
# stay, the random picks are fresh (none of the previous set's), and the
# books keep at most 3 random places (all of the mini library's books are
# pinned, so its book share is the pinned ones; artfmt's host test covers
# 3 of 8). A due rotation never wakes storage: it waits for a natural
# wake. The pool is topped up first (a paused window) so the random picks
# have room to be fresh.
#   SIM_BUILD=build/sim-ui scripts/shots.sh tests/ui/ipodui-p16-panel-rotate.script
# needs: library
# golden: skip
# log: expect_panel_rotated ok
# log: expect_panel_kept ok
# log: expect_panel_books_random ok
# logbetween: r0 r1 art panel rotate shown=32
# logbetween: r0 r1 no art panel stream
# logbetween: w0 w1 no art panel rotate
# logbetween: w1 w2 art panel rotate shown=32
# logbetween: w1 w2 no art panel stream
# nolog: expect_panel_\w+ failed
# nolog: art fail
# timeout: 400
wait 1000
wait_db 30000
art_wait 120000
wheel +4            # Shuffle Songs
wait 500
key SELECT
wait 2000
key PLAY            # pause
wait 1500
backlight_expire
art_wait 60000
pause_age 200       # a window: the pool's top-up
wait 3000
art_wait 240000
key MENU
wait 1000
# 1. a restart
panel_shown_mark
ab_mark r0
reboot
wait 1000
wait_db 30000
art_wait 120000
ab_mark r1
expect_panel_rotated
expect_panel_books_random
shot restart
# 2. three hours later, storage asleep: nothing until a natural wake
wait 7000           # the disk's idle hold is over
panel_shown_mark
ab_mark w0
panel_rotate_warp 10800
wait 3000
expect_panel_kept
ab_mark w1
disk_active 2500    # a natural wake (a refill, a read)
wait 3000
ab_mark w2
expect_panel_rotated
expect_panel_books_random
key SELECT          # Music: the drift shows the new set
wait 3000
shot rotated
quit
